# Keys and caches: answering from memory, and trusting signed requests.
puzzle cacheHit
    chapter "Keys and caches"
    name "Cache hit"
    about "There is no storage anywhere on this map, but a cache answers queries from memory. Finish the pipeline and serve 60 responses."
    fresh
    patch users at 0 4 size 2 1 amount 1
    stock response 160 rows 30
    researched microservices caching
